OL,3,GNEWSAWork to build park and ride to
OL,4,Astart in January
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to build a new #54m park and ride
OL,7,Fsite on the outskirts of Cambridge will
OL,8,Fstart in January, planners have
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FGreater Cambridge Partnership (GCP)
OL,12,Fsaid it had appointed a contractor to
OL,13,Fbuild the new site at Hauxton, just off
OL,14,Fjunction 11 of the M11.
OL,16,FThe site will have parking for more
OL,17,Fthan 2,000 cars and about 500 bicycles
OL,18,Fand is expected to be completed by the
OL,19,Fsummer of 2028.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
